{
  "description": "Read-only correlation of MongoDB, MQTT, ingest lag and sample age. Classifies an evidence gap for human follow-up; does not restart infrastructure.",
  "published": true,
  "sensitivePrivileges": false,
  "tags": [
    "project:smiot",
    "env:demo",
    "service:smiot-smart-farm",
    "plan:workflow-05",
    "safety:read-only"
  ],
  "name": "SMIOT | W5 | Root cause dependency triage",
  "spec": {
    "steps": [
      {
        "display": {
          "bounds": {
            "y": 96,
            "x": 0
          }
        },
        "errorHandlers": [
          {
            "fallbackStepName": "escalate_query_failed",
            "retryStrategy": {
              "linear": {
                "interval": "1s",
                "maxRetries": 1
              },
              "kind": "RETRY_STRATEGY_LINEAR"
            }
          }
        ],
        "name": "read_operational_signals",
        "actionId": "com.datadoghq.dd.metrics.queryScalarData",
        "outboundEdges": [
          {
            "nextStepName": "classify_evidence",
            "branchName": "main"
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "value": "10m",
            "name": "range"
          },
          {
            "value": [
              {
                "aggregator": "last",
                "name": "mongo_up",
                "query": "min:smiot.dependency.mongo.up{*}",
                "data_source": "metrics"
              },
              {
                "aggregator": "last",
                "name": "mqtt_up",
                "query": "min:smiot.dependency.mqtt.up{*}",
                "data_source": "metrics"
              },
              {
                "aggregator": "last",
                "name": "ingest_lag_ms",
                "query": "max:smiot.telemetry.ingest_lag_ms{*}",
                "data_source": "metrics"
              },
              {
                "aggregator": "last",
                "name": "sample_age_s",
                "query": "max:smiot.telemetry.sample_age_seconds{*}",
                "data_source": "metrics"
              }
            ],
            "name": "queries"
          },
          {
            "value": [
              {
                "formula": "mongo_up"
              },
              {
                "formula": "mqtt_up"
              },
              {
                "formula": "ingest_lag_ms"
              },
              {
                "formula": "sample_age_s"
              }
            ],
            "name": "formulas"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "display": {
          "bounds": {
            "y": 264,
            "x": 0
          }
        },
        "name": "classify_evidence",
        "outboundEdges": [
          {
            "nextStepName": "evidence_observed",
            "branchName": "true"
          },
          {
            "nextStepName": "escalate_or_review",
            "branchName": "false"
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "value": "and",
            "name": "joinOperator"
          },
          {
            "value": [
              {
                "comparisonOperator": "eq",
                "leftValue": "${ (() => { const c=Steps.read_operational_signals.data?.attributes?.columns || []; const n=k=>Number(c.find(x=>x.name===k)?.values?.[0]); const m=n(\"mongo_up\"), q=n(\"mqtt_up\"), l=n(\"ingest_lag_ms\"), a=n(\"sample_age_s\"); return (Number.isFinite(m)&&m<1)||(Number.isFinite(q)&&q<1)||(Number.isFinite(l)&&l>5000)||(Number.isFinite(a)&&a>120); })() }",
                "rightValue": true
              }
            ],
            "name": "conditions"
          }
        ],
        "actionId": "com.datadoghq.core.if"
      },
      {
        "display": {
          "bounds": {
            "y": 432,
            "x": 0
          }
        },
        "name": "evidence_observed",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "value": "W5 | DEPENDENCY_DEGRADATION_EVIDENCE | Compare Mongo ping/persistence, MQTT consumer/broker, ingest lag and sample age; open the matching logs/traces and correlate by farm/time. No restart is authorized by this workflow.",
            "name": "value"
          }
        ],
        "actionId": "com.datadoghq.core.echo"
      },
      {
        "display": {
          "bounds": {
            "y": 432,
            "x": 0
          }
        },
        "name": "escalate_or_review",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "value": "W5 | NO_ROOT_CAUSE_CONFIRMED | No dependency threshold was confirmed or data is missing. Preserve uncertainty and escalate with monitor group/log/trace links; no infrastructure action.",
            "name": "value"
          }
        ],
        "actionId": "com.datadoghq.core.echo"
      },
      {
        "display": {
          "bounds": {
            "y": 96,
            "x": 0
          }
        },
        "name": "escalate_query_failed",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "value": "SMIOT | W5 | Root cause dependency triage | QUERY_FAILED | Evidence unavailable; fail closed and hand to an operator. No actuator or infrastructure action.",
            "name": "value"
          }
        ],
        "actionId": "com.datadoghq.core.echo"
      }
    ],
    "handle": "smiot-w05-root-cause-triage",
    "triggers": [
      {
        "startStepNames": [
          "read_operational_signals"
        ],
        "monitorTrigger": {
          "rateLimit": {
            "count": 1,
            "interval": "300s"
          }
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
